     of the string (not including the NULL terminator) in the location pointed
     to by _l_e_n___p.  If the ACL is POSIX.1e, the format of the text string re‐
     turned by aaccll__ttoo__tteexxtt() shall be the POSIX.1e long ACL form.  If the ACL
